          <h1 class="hero-title">Sovereign care for<br/><span class="hero-shimmer">neurodivergent families</span></h1>
          <p style="font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-secondary);max-width:42rem;margin:0 auto 2rem;line-height:1.7;">P31 Labs builds free, open-source tools grounded in care science. We design for the moments that matter &mdash; meltdowns, transitions, mornings, nights.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center mb-10" style="gap:2.5rem;">
