      <section id="about" class="section">
        <div class="container px-6">
          <h2 class="section-title">Mission &amp; About</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Every neurodivergent family invents workarounds for a world not designed for them. P31 Labs turns those workarounds into shared, open-source tools.</p>
          <div class="grid-4 mb-16">
            <details class="glass-card" style="cursor:pointer;">
              <summary style="list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text);">Mission<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);transition:transform 0.2s;"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></summary>
              <div class="mt-4" style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;">To build free, open-source assistive technology that honors the sovereignty of neurodivergent families. Every tool is designed for the reality of family life &mdash; not the abstraction of it.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="glass-card" style="cursor:pointer;">
              <summary style="list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text);">Vision<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);transition:transform 0.2s;"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></summary>
              <div class="mt-4" style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;">A world where neurodivergent families flourish with tools that adapt to them &mdash; not the other way around. Where care work is seen, valued, and rewarded.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="glass-card" style="cursor:pointer;">
              <summary style="list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text);">Values<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);transition:transform 0.2s;"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></summary>
              <div class="mt-4 space-y-2" style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;">
                <div><span class="accent-cyan" style="font-weight:600;">Sovereignty</span> &mdash; You own your data. No tracking, no ads, no extraction.</div>
                <div><span class="accent-violet" style="font-weight:600;">Care-First</span> &mdash; Every product grounded in care science, designed for real family dynamics.</div>
                <div><span class="accent-gold" style="font-weight:600;">Open Source</span> &mdash; MIT licensed. Free forever. Auditable by anyone.</div>
                <div><span class="accent-green" style="font-weight:600;">Spoon-Aware</span> &mdash; Interfaces adapt to your capacity, from crisis to flow.</div>
              </div>
            </details>
            <details class="glass-card" style="cursor:pointer;">
              <summary style="list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text);">Principles<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);transition:transform 0.2s;"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></summary>
              <div class="mt-4 space-y-2" style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;">
                <div>&bull; Build for the most vulnerable first</div>
                <div>&bull; Design for crisis as a default state</div>
                <div>&bull; Measure success in spoons saved, not revenue</div>
                <div>&bull; Share everything &mdash; code, research, lessons</div>
                <div>&bull; Stay small, stay sovereign, stay accountable</div>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-8 mb-12">
            <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The Family as Architecture</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:48rem;">Our infrastructure is named after the members of the family that founded P31. Each worker embodies a care role &mdash; because the family IS the architecture.</p>
            <div class="grid-4">
              <div class="text-center glass-card"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);">BOB</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Structural Expert</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:0.25rem;">Bounding &amp; Ordering Bridge</div></div>
              <div class="text-center glass-card"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-violet);">MARGE</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Design Expert</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:0.25rem;">Material &amp; Aesthetic Reasoning<br/>Guidance Engine</div></div>
              <div class="text-center glass-card"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-gold);">WILLOW</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Somatic Guide</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:0.25rem;">Wellness &amp; Interactive Learning<br/>for Living, Optimized for you</div></div>
              <div class="text-center glass-card"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-green);">BASH</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Comms Protocol</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:0.25rem;">Behavioral &amp; Affective<br/>Signaling Hub</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-2 grid-1-lg">
            <div class="glass-panel p-8">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Team</h3>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,240,255,0.2),rgba(167,139,250,0.2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:1.125rem;color:var(--accent);">WJ</div>
                <div>
                  <div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;">Will Johnson</div>
                  <div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;">Founder &amp; Executive Director</div>
                  <div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);margin-top:0.25rem;"><a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0002-2492-9079" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--accent);opacity:0.7;">ORCID: 0009-0002-2492-9079</a></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.875rem;margin-top:1rem;">Built in SE Georgia by a family, for families.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-panel p-8">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Transparency</h3>
              <div class="space-y-4" style="font-size:0.875rem;">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(0,240,255,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent);">EIN</span></div><div><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">42-1888158</span><br/><span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Georgia 501(c)(3) nonprofit corporation</span></div></div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-violet);">FS</span></div><div><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Fiscal Sponsor</span><br/><span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">501(c)(3) sponsorship pending. Donations non-deductible until recognized.</span></div></div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-gold);">OS</span></div><div><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Open Source</span><br/><span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Every line of code is MIT-licensed on <a href="https://github.com/p31labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-glow">GitHub</a>.</span></div></div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(52,211,153,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-green);">P</span></div><div><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Privacy</span><br/><span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Zero analytics, zero tracking, zero data harvesting.</span></div></div>
