            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;">1,247</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">&#x2665; LOVE Generated</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-top:0.125rem;">Care-credit rewards issued</div></div>
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;">5</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">Apps Deployed</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-top:0.125rem;">PHOS, WILLOW, BONDING, + more</div></div>
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;">14</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">Workers Live</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-top:0.125rem;">On the P31 sovereign mesh</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-2 grid-1-lg mb-16">
            <div class="glass-panel p-8">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Pilot Dashboard</h3>
              <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">Real-time family care metrics and platform health.</p>
              <div style="aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,240,255,0.05),rgba(167,139,250,0.05));border:1px solid var(--glass-border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
                <div class="text-center"><div style="color:var(--accent);font-size:1.875rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;">&#x25A0;&#x25A0;&#x25A0;</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);">PILOT DASHBOARD</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:10px;margin-top:0.25rem;">Coming Q3 2026</div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-panel p-8">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Love Leaderboard</h3>
              <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">Top care contributors in the P31 community.</p>
              <div style="aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(251,191,36,0.05),rgba(52,211,153,0.05));border:1px solid var(--glass-border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
                <div class="text-center"><div style="color:var(--accent-gold);font-size:1.875rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;">&#x2665;&#x2665;&#x2665;</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);">LOVE LEADERBOARD</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:10px;margin-top:0.25rem;">Coming Q3 2026</div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-8 mb-16 overflow-hidden">
            <h3 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">What Families Say</h3>
            <div class="flex gap-6 overflow-x-auto" style="padding-bottom:1rem;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;">
              <div class="glass-card flex-shrink-0" style="min-width:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;"><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">&ldquo;P31 tools have transformed our mornings. The spoon-aware interface means my AuDHD son can actually use it without overwhelm.&rdquo;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,240,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent);">S</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Sarah M.</span><span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-left:0.5rem;">Pilot Family</span></div></div></div>
              <div class="glass-card flex-shrink-0" style="min-width:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;"><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">&ldquo;The LOVE ledger showed me I&rsquo;d done 47 hours of care coordination in one week. For the first time, someone counted it.&rdquo;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(167,139,250,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-violet);">M</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Marcus J.</span><span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-left:0.5rem;">Pilot Family</span></div></div></div>
              <div class="glass-card flex-shrink-0" style="min-width:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;"><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">&ldquo;Open source assistive tech that actually works and doesn&rsquo;t sell our data. This is what we&rsquo;ve been waiting for.&rdquo;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(251,191,36,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-gold);">A</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Aisha K.</span><span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-left:0.5rem;">Pilot Family</span></div></div></div>
              <div class="glass-card flex-shrink-0" style="min-width:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;"><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">&ldquo;My daughter uses the Cognitive Passport to tell her teachers what she needs without having to explain it every time. That&rsquo;s dignity.&rdquo;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(52,211,153,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-green);">D</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">David R.</span><span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-left:0.5rem;">Pilot Family</span></div></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative">
            <div style="position:absolute;left:1rem;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(0,240,255,0.4),rgba(167,139,250,0.4),transparent);"></div>
            <div class="space-y-6" style="padding-left:3rem;">
              <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span style="padding:0.125rem 0.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius-full);background:rgba(0,240,255,0.1);color:var(--accent);font-size:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;">2024</span></div><h4 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;">Founded</h4><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;">P31 Labs incorporated as Georgia nonprofit. Core architecture designed: K&#x2084; tetrahedron model for care coordination.</p></div>
              <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span style="padding:0.125rem 0.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius-full);background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);color:var(--accent-violet);font-size:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;">2025</span></div><h4 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;">Prototypes &amp; Pilots</h4><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;">PHOS, BONDING, and WILLOW prototypes launched. First pilot families onboarded. LOVE care-credit protocol designed.</p></div>
              <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span style="padding:0.125rem 0.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius-full);background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);color:var(--accent-gold);font-size:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;">2026</span></div><h4 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;">Mesh Expansion</h4><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;">14 Workers live on Cloudflare. 18 pilot families active. NGI TALER and Fediversity proposals submitted. eIDAS alignment in progress. LOVE ledger deployed.</p></div>
              <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span style="padding:0.125rem 0.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius-full);background:rgba(52,211,153,0.1);color:var(--accent-green);font-size:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;">2027+</span></div><h4 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;">Scaling Sovereignty</h4><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;">Pilot expansion to 100+ families. LOVE as a recognized care-credit standard. Federation bridge live across EUDI-compliant infrastructure.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
