      <section id="research-section" class="section">
        <div class="container px-6">
          <h2 class="section-title">Research</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Open research publications, grants, and standards alignment driving neurodivergent sovereignty.</p>
          <div class="grid-3 mb-12">
            <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(0,240,255,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--accent);">K&#x2084;</span></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;">The K&#x2084; Tetrahedron</h3></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.7;">Complete graph topology for neurodivergent care coordination.</p><a href="https://zenodo.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-glow" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:0.75rem;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">Read on Zenodo &rarr;</a></div>
            <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--accent-violet);">G</span></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;">Genesis Whitepaper</h3></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.7;">Foundational framework for sovereign neurodivergent identity and care proofs.</p><a href="https://zenodo.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-glow" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:0.75rem;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">Read on Zenodo &rarr;</a></div>
            <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--accent-gold);">&#x2726;</span></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;">The Geodesic Self</h3></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.7;">Ongoing research on care science and neurodivergent identity.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(52,211,153,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--accent-green);">T</span></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;">NGI TALER</h3></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.7;">Privacy-preserving care payments via GNU Taler integration.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(0,240,255,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--accent);">F</span></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;">NGI Fediversity</h3></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.7;">Federated neurodivergent identity and credential exchange.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--accent-violet);">E</span></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;">eIDAS Alignment</h3></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.7;">EU Digital Identity Wallet compliance for P31 credentials.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-8">
            <h3 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Grants &amp; Standards Alignment</h3>
            <div class="grid-3" style="font-size:0.875rem;">
              <div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);"></span><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">NGI TALER</span></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Privacy-preserving care payments via GNU Taler. Proposal submitted to NLnet.</p><a href="https://taler.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-glow" style="font-size:0.75rem;">taler.net &rarr;</a></div>
              <div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-violet);"></span><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">NGI Fediversity</span></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Federated neurodivergent identity and credential exchange. Proposal submitted.</p></div>
              <div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-gold);"></span><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">eIDAS Alignment</span></div><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">EU Digital Identity Wallet compliance for P31 credentials. In progress.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-8" style="padding-top:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--glass-border);">
              <a href="https://zenodo.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-glow" style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;">Zenodo &rarr;</a>
