            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-8">
            <h3 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Onboarding Flow</h3>
            <div class="grid-4" style="align-items:center;">
              <div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(0,240,255,0.2);color:var(--accent);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">1</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">Discover</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Find P31 through community or research</div></div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:flex hidden" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:1.125rem;">&#x2192;</div>
              <div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(167,139,250,0.2);color:var(--accent-violet);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">2</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">DID Setup</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Create your sovereign Decentralized Identifier</div></div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:flex hidden" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:1.125rem;">&#x2192;</div>
              <div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(251,191,36,0.2);color:var(--accent-gold);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">3</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">Pilot Onboard</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Join the pilot program and access tools</div></div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:flex hidden" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:1.125rem;">&#x2192;</div>
              <div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(52,211,153,0.2);color:var(--accent-green);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">4</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">Care Proofs</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Earn LOVE for care coordination work</div></div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:flex hidden" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:1.125rem;">&#x2192;</div>
              <div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(0,240,255,0.2);color:var(--accent);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">5</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">Shape Roadmap</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Your feedback guides our priorities</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="blog-section" class="section">
        <div class="container px-6">
          <h2 class="section-title">Blog</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Notes from the lab &mdash; engineering, care science, and the sovereignty stack.</p>
          <div class="grid-2">
            <article class="glass-card">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);"><span>July 2026</span><span>&middot;</span><span>8 min</span></div>
              <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">The Cosmic Cradle</h3>
              <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">On the engineering of sovereign care &mdash; why we built a tetrahedral architecture for neurodivergent families, and how the K&#x2084; graph maps the invisible labor of love.</p>
              <a href="#" class="link-glow" style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">Read More &rarr;</a>
            </article>
            <article class="glass-card">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);"><span>July 2026</span><span>&middot;</span><span>12 min</span></div>
              <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Building the P31 Sovereign Mesh</h3>
              <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">How 14 Cloudflare Workers, 5 applications, and a shared D1 database form the backbone of a nonprofit infrastructure designed for care, not extraction.</p>
              <a href="#" class="link-glow" style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">Read More &rarr;</a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="padding-bottom:5rem;">
        <div style="max-width:48rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem;text-align:center;">
          <div class="glass-panel p-8" style="border:1px solid rgba(0,240,255,0.2);">
            <div style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,240,255,0.2),rgba(167,139,250,0.2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;">
              <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3.172 5.172a4 4 0 015.656 0L10 6.343l1.172-1.171a4 4 0 115.656 5.656L10 17.657l-6.828-6.829a4 4 0 010-5.656z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Support Sovereign Care</h2>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:32rem;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;">P31 Labs is 100% community-funded. No venture capital, no data extraction, no ads. Every donation builds free tools for families who need them most.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
              <a href="https://ko-fi.com/trimtab69420" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9.653 16.915l-.005-.003-.019-.01a20.759 20.759 0 01-1.587-1.058c-.79-.6-1.823-1.488-2.774-2.66C3.93 11.563 3 9.7 3 7.5 3 4.462 5.462 2 8.5 2c1.423 0 2.742.523 3.746 1.43C13.25 2.523 14.577 2 16 2 19.038 2 21.5 4.462 21.5 7.5c0 2.2-.93 4.063-2.293 5.687-.95 1.172-1.984 2.059-2.774 2.66a20.679 20.679 0 01-1.587 1.058l-.019.01-.005.003-.002.001c-.238.128-.516.179-.82.179s-.582-.051-.82-.179z"/></svg> Donate on Ko-fi</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/p31labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg> GitHub</a>
              <a href="https://discord.gg/uYW5rTCuZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-ghost"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.317 4.37a19.791 19.791 0 00-4.885-1.515.074.074 0 00-.079.037c-.21.375-.444.864-.608 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 00-5.487 0 12.64 12.64 0 00-.617-1.25.077.077 0 00-.079-.037A19.736 19.736 0 003.677 4.37a.07.07 0 00-.032.027C.533 9.046-.32 13.58.099 18.057a.082.082 0 00.031.057 19.9 19.9 0 005.993 3.03.078.078 0 00.084-.028 14.09 14.09 0 001.226-1.994.076.076 0 00-.041-.106 13.107 13.107 0 01-1.872-.892.077.077 0 01-.008-.128 10.2 10.2 0 00.372-.292.074.074 0 01.077-.01c3.928 1.793 8.18 1.793 12.062 0a.074.074 0 01.078.01c.12.098.246.198.373.292a.077.077 0 01-.006.127 12.299 12.299 0 01-1.873.892.077.077 0 00-.041.107c.36.698.772 1.362 1.225 1.993a.076.076 0 00.084.028 19.839 19.839 0 006.002-3.03.077.077 0 00.032-.054c.5-5.177-.838-9.674-3.549-13.66a.061.061 0 00-.031-.03zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.956-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.956 2.418-2.157 2.418zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.955-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.946 2.418-2.157 2.418z"/></svg> Discord</a>
