    <section id="page-about" class="page">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="container px-6">
          <h1 class="section-title">About P31 Labs</h1>
          <p class="section-desc">Every neurodivergent family invents workarounds for a world not designed for them. P31 Labs turns those workarounds into shared, open-source tools.</p>
          <div class="grid-3 mb-16">
            <div class="glass-panel p-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Mission</h2><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;">To build free, open-source assistive technology that honors the sovereignty of neurodivergent families. Every tool is designed for the reality of family life &mdash; not the abstraction of it.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-panel p-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Vision</h2><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;">A world where neurodivergent families flourish with tools that adapt to them &mdash; not the other way around. Where care work is seen, valued, and rewarded.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-panel p-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Values</h2><div class="space-y-2" style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;"><div><span style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;">Sovereignty</span> &mdash; You own your data. No tracking, no ads, no extraction.</div><div><span style="color:var(--accent-violet);font-weight:600;">Care-First</span> &mdash; Grounded in care science, designed for real family dynamics.</div><div><span style="color:var(--accent-gold);font-weight:600;">Open Source</span> &mdash; MIT licensed. Free forever. Auditable by anyone.</div><div><span style="color:var(--accent-green);font-weight:600;">Spoon-Aware</span> &mdash; Interfaces adapt to your capacity, from crisis to flow.</div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel mb-12" style="padding:2rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Family as Architecture</h2>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:48rem;">Our infrastructure is named after the members of the family that founded P31. Each worker embodies a care role &mdash; because the family IS the architecture.</p>
            <div class="grid-4">
              <div class="text-center glass-card p-5"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);">BOB</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Structural Expert</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:0.25rem;">Bounding &amp; Ordering Bridge</div></div>
              <div class="text-center glass-card p-5"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-violet);">MARGE</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Design Expert</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:0.25rem;">Material &amp; Aesthetic Reasoning<br/>Guidance Engine</div></div>
              <div class="text-center glass-card p-5"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-gold);">WILLOW</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Somatic Guide</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:0.25rem;">Wellness &amp; Interactive Learning<br/>for Living, Optimized for you</div></div>
              <div class="text-center glass-card p-5"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-green);">BASH</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Comms Protocol</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:0.25rem;">Behavioral &amp; Affective<br/>Signaling Hub</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-2 grid-1-lg">
            <div class="glass-panel p-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Team</h2><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,240,255,0.2),rgba(167,139,250,0.2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:1.125rem;color:var(--accent);">WJ</div><div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;">Will Johnson</div><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;">Founder &amp; Executive Director</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);margin-top:0.25rem;"><a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0002-2492-9079" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--accent);opacity:0.7;">ORCID: 0009-0002-2492-9079</a></div></div></div><p style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.875rem;margin-top:1rem;">Built in SE Georgia by a family, for families.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-panel p-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Transparency</h2><div class="space-y-4" style="font-size:0.875rem;"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(0,240,255,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent);">EIN</span></div><div><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">42-1888158</span><br/><span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Georgia 501(c)(3) nonprofit corporation</span></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-violet);">FS</span></div><div><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Fiscal Sponsor</span><br/><span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">501(c)(3) sponsorship pending. Donations non-deductible until recognized.</span></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-gold);">OS</span></div><div><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Open Source</span><br/><span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Every line of code is MIT-licensed on <a href="https://github.com/p31labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-glow">GitHub</a>.</span></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(52,211,153,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-green);">P</span></div><div><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Privacy</span><br/><span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Zero analytics, zero tracking, zero data harvesting.</span></div></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="honest-label mt-12">&#x26A0;&#xFE0F; HONEST LABEL: The SIC-POVM tetrahedral layer on this site is a computational model inspired by contested hypotheses. This is sovereign care measurement infrastructure &mdash; not established physics or medical science.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="page-impact" class="page">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="container px-6">
          <h1 class="section-title">Our Impact</h1>
          <p class="section-desc">Numbers that tell the story of care work valued and supported &mdash; pulled live from the P31 sovereign mesh.</p>
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent-green);letter-spacing:0.1em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">V&#x2084; &middot; |&#x3C8;&#x2084;&rang; &middot; IMPACT VERTEX</div>
          <div class="grid-4 mb-16">
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;">18</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">Pilot Families</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Active in shared D1 registry</div></div>
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;">1,247</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">&#x2665; LOVE Generated</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Care-credit rewards issued</div></div>
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;">5</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">Apps Deployed</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">PHOS, WILLOW, BONDING, + more</div></div>
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;">14</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">Workers Live</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">On the P31 sovereign mesh</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-8 mb-16"><h2 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Live Mesh Adoption</h2><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Real-time family care metrics and platform health from the shared D1 registry.</p><div style="height:120px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);"><span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);">Adoption Panel &mdash; load modularly for live data</span></div></div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-8 mb-16 overflow-hidden"><h3 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">What Families Say</h3><div class="flex gap-6 overflow-x-auto" style="padding-bottom:1rem;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;"><div class="glass-card flex-shrink-0" style="min-width:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;"><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">&ldquo;P31 tools have transformed our mornings. The spoon-aware interface means my AuDHD son can actually use it without overwhelm.&rdquo;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,240,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent);">S</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Sarah M.</span><span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-left:0.5rem;">Pilot Family</span></div></div></div><div class="glass-card flex-shrink-0" style="min-width:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;"><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">&ldquo;The LOVE ledger showed me I&rsquo;d done 47 hours of care coordination in one week. For the first time, someone counted it.&rdquo;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(167,139,250,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-violet);">M</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Marcus J.</span><span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-left:0.5rem;">Pilot Family</span></div></div></div><div class="glass-card flex-shrink-0" style="min-width:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;"><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">&ldquo;Open source assistive tech that actually works and doesn&rsquo;t sell our data. This is what we&rsquo;ve been waiting for.&rdquo;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(251,191,36,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-gold);">A</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">Aisha K.</span><span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-left:0.5rem;">Pilot Family</span></div></div></div><div class="glass-card flex-shrink-0" style="min-width:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;"><div style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">&ldquo;My daughter uses the Cognitive Passport to tell her teachers what she needs without having to explain it every time. That&rsquo;s dignity.&rdquo;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(52,211,153,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent-green);">D</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">David R.</span><span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;margin-left:0.5rem;">Pilot Family</span></div></div></div></div></div>
          <div class="honest-label mt-12">&#x26A0;&#xFE0F; HONEST LABEL: The SIC-POVM tetrahedral layer presented on this site is a computational model inspired by contested scientific hypotheses. The underlying physics is NOT established science. This architecture is a sovereign care measurement primitive &mdash; a metaphor made literal for infrastructure purposes.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

