          <p class="section-desc">Notes from the lab &mdash; engineering, care science, and the sovereignty stack.</p>
          <div class="grid-2">
            <article class="glass-card"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);"><span>July 2026</span><span>&middot;</span><span>8 min</span></div><h3 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">The Cosmic Cradle</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;">On the engineering of sovereign care &mdash; why we built a tetrahedral architecture for neurodivergent families, and how the K&#x2084; graph maps the invisible labor of love.</p><a href="#" class="link-glow" style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">Read More &rarr;</a></article>
