    <section id="page-get-involved" class="page">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="container px-6">
          <h1 class="section-title">Get Involved</h1>
          <p class="section-desc">Every contribution matters. Join us in building sovereign care technology.</p>
          <div class="grid-4 mb-16">
            <div class="glass-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;"><div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(0,240,255,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent);"><path d="M10 1a6 6 0 00-3.815 10.631C7.237 12.5 8 13.443 8 14.456v.644a.75.75 0 00.572.729 6.016 6.016 0 002.856 0A.75.75 0 0012 15.1v-.644c0-1.013.763-1.957 1.815-2.825A6 6 0 0010 1zM8.863 17.414a.75.75 0 00-.226 1.483 9.066 9.066 0 002.726 0 .75.75 0 00-.226-1.483 7.553 7.553 0 01-2.274 0z"/></svg></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Join the Pilot</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;flex:1;margin-bottom:1rem;">Be among the first families to use P31 tools. Shape the roadmap with your feedback.</p><a href="https://phos.p31ca.org/portal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:0.75rem;text-align:center;justify-content:center;">Apply Now</a></div>
            <div class="glass-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;"><div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent-violet);"><path d="M9.653 16.915l-.005-.003-.019-.01a20.759 20.759 0 01-1.587-1.058c-.79-.6-1.823-1.488-2.774-2.66C3.93 11.563 3 9.7 3 7.5 3 4.462 5.462 2 8.5 2c1.423 0 2.742.523 3.746 1.43C13.25 2.523 14.577 2 16 2 19.038 2 21.5 4.462 21.5 7.5c0 2.2-.93 4.063-2.293 5.687-.95 1.172-1.984 2.059-2.774 2.66a20.679 20.679 0 01-1.587 1.058l-.019.01-.005.003-.002.001c-.238.128-.516.179-.82.179s-.582-.051-.82-.179z"/></svg></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Donate LOVE</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;flex:1;margin-bottom:1rem;">Support free assistive technology with LOVE care-credits or USDC. Every donation goes directly to building tools.</p><a href="https://ko-fi.com/trimtab69420" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-ghost" style="font-size:0.75rem;text-align:center;">Donate on Ko-fi &rarr;</a></div>
            <div class="glass-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;"><div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent-gold);"><path d="M10.362 1.093a.75.75 0 00-.724 0L2.523 5.018 10 9.143l7.477-4.125-7.115-3.925zM18 6.443l-7.25 4v8.25l6.862-3.786A.75.75 0 0018 14.25V6.443zm-8.75 12.25v-8.25l-7.25-4v7.807a.75.75 0 00.388.657l6.862 3.786z"/></svg></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Volunteer</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;flex:1;margin-bottom:1rem;">Contribute code, design, research, or advocacy. All skills welcome.</p><a href="https://github.com/p31labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary" style="font-size:0.75rem;text-align:center;">Get Started</a></div>
            <div class="glass-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;"><div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:rgba(52,211,153,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent-green);"><path d="M13 6a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zM18 8a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM14 15a4 4 0 00-8 0v3h8v-3zM6 8a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM16 18v-3a5.972 5.972 0 00-.75-2.906A3.005 3.005 0 0119 15v3h-3zM4.75 12.094A5.973 5.973 0 004 15v3H1v-3a3 3 0 013.75-2.906z"/></svg></div><h3 style="color:var(--text);font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Partner</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.75rem;flex:1;margin-bottom:1rem;">Research institutions, care organizations, and grant partners.</p><a href="mailto:will@p31ca.org" class="btn-ghost" style="font-size:0.75rem;text-align:center;">Contact Us</a></div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-8"><h3 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Onboarding Flow</h3><div class="grid-4" style="align-items:center;"><div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(0,240,255,0.2);color:var(--accent);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">1</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">Discover</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Find P31 through community or research</div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center md:flex hidden" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:1.125rem;">&#x2192;</div><div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(167,139,250,0.2);color:var(--accent-violet);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">2</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">DID Setup</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Create your sovereign Decentralized Identifier</div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center md:flex hidden" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:1.125rem;">&#x2192;</div><div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(251,191,36,0.2);color:var(--accent-gold);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">3</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">Pilot Onboard</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Join the pilot program and access tools</div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center md:flex hidden" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:1.125rem;">&#x2192;</div><div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(52,211,153,0.2);color:var(--accent-green);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">4</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">Care Proofs</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Earn LOVE for care coordination work</div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center md:flex hidden" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:1.125rem;">&#x2192;</div><div class="text-center" style="padding:0.75rem;"><div class="step-circle" style="background:rgba(0,240,255,0.2);color:var(--accent);margin:0 auto 0.5rem;">5</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;">Shape Roadmap</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Your feedback guides our priorities</div></div></div></div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-8 mt-12 text-center" style="border:1px solid rgba(0,240,255,0.2);"><h3 style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Support Sovereign Care</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:32rem;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;">P31 Labs is 100% community-funded. No venture capital, no data extraction, no ads. Every donation builds free tools for families who need them most.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4"><a href="https://ko-fi.com/trimtab69420" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9.653 16.915l-.005-.003-.019-.01a20.759 20.759 0 01-1.587-1.058c-.79-.6-1.823-1.488-2.774-2.66C3.93 11.563 3 9.7 3 7.5 3 4.462 5.462 2 8.5 2c1.423 0 2.742.523 3.746 1.43C13.25 2.523 14.577 2 16 2 19.038 2 21.5 4.462 21.5 7.5c0 2.2-.93 4.063-2.293 5.687-.95 1.172-1.984 2.059-2.774 2.66a20.679 20.679 0 01-1.587 1.058l-.019.01-.005.003-.002.001c-.238.128-.516.179-.82.179s-.582-.051-.82-.179z"/></svg> Donate on Ko-fi</a><a href="https://github.com/p31labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12