    <section id="page-quantum" class="page">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="container px-6">
          <h1 class="section-title">Quantum Core</h1>
          <p class="section-desc">SIC-POVM tetrahedral architecture &mdash; the computational primitive powering sovereign care measurement on the P31 mesh.</p>
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl mb-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">SIC-POVM &middot; d=2 &middot; 4 States</h2><div class="grid-4"><div class="text-center p-3" style="background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);"><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-tertiary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;">d</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">2</div></div><div class="text-center p-3" style="background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);"><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-tertiary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;">states</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">4</div></div><div class="text-center p-3" style="background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);"><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-tertiary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;">overlap</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">1/3</div></div><div class="text-center p-3" style="background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);"><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-tertiary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;">family</div><div style="font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">tetrahedral</div></div></div></div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl mb-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">K&#x2084; Topology</h2><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-bottom:1rem;">V=4 &middot; E=6 &middot; Planar &middot; &#x3B2;&#x2082;=1</div><div style="height:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);"><span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);">K&#x2084; Mesh &mdash; load modularly</span></div></div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl mb-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Posner Molecule Ca&#x2089;(PO&#x2084;)&#x2086;</h2><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-bottom:1rem;">9 Ca &middot; 6 P &middot; 12 O &middot; n=2e&#x2070;&middot;&#x2075;</div><div style="height:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);"><span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);">Posner Molecule &mdash; load modularly</span></div></div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl"><div class="honest-label">&#x26A0;&#xFE0F; HONEST LABEL: This system implements a computational model inspired by SIC-POVM quantum information theory. The tetrahedral framework is an architectural metaphor for sovereign care measurement infrastructure. Underlying physical hypotheses (e.g., Posner molecule quantum cognition) remain scientifically contested.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="page-care" class="page">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="container px-6">
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent-violet);letter-spacing:0.1em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">V&#x2082; &middot; |&#x3C8;&#x2082;&rang; &middot; CARE VERTEX</div>
          <h1 class="section-title">Care Economy</h1>
          <p class="section-desc">The LOVE care-credit protocol &mdash; rewarding the work of caregiving with non-extractive, privacy-preserving infrastructure built on the P31 sovereign mesh.</p>
          <div class="grid-4 mb-12">
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;color:var(--accent-violet);">1,247</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">LOVE Generated</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Care-credit rewards issued on ledger</div></div>
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;color:var(--accent);">47</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">Avg Weekly Hours</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Care coordination per family</div></div>
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;color:var(--accent-green);">18</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">Pilot Families</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Active on sovereign mesh</div></div>
            <div class="glass-card text-center"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem;color:var(--accent-gold);">&#x20AC;0</div><div style="color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem;">Platform Fees</div><div style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.75rem;">Non-extractive by design</div></div>
          </div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1rem;">Care Infrastructure</h2>
          <div class="grid-2 mb-12">
            <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-xl"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);">LOVE Economy</h3><span style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);padding:0 0.5rem;padding-top:0.125rem;padding-bottom:0.125rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:var(--text-tertiary);">Live</span></div><p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Non-extractive care-credit protocol rewarding the work of caregiving. Rewards issued for coordination, transport, advocacy, and sensory regulation.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-xl"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);">PHOS</h3><span style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);padding:0 0.5rem;padding-top:0.125rem;padding-bottom:0.125rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:var(--text-tertiary);">Live</span></div><p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Sovereign care coordination platform for neurodivergent families. Spoon-aware scheduling, shared D1 registry, privacy-preserving.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-xl"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);">WILLOW</h3><span style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);padding:0 0.5rem;padding-top:0.125rem;padding-bottom:0.125rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:var(--text-tertiary);">Beta</span></div><p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Somatic regulation and sensory mindfulness toolkit. 863 Hz Larmor-frequency grounding exercises.</p></div>
            <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-xl"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);">Cognitive Passport</h3><span style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);padding:0 0.5rem;padding-top:0.125rem;padding-bottom:0.125rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:var(--text-tertiary);">Research</span></div><p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">Portable neurodivergent identity and accommodation credential. Court-admissible, eIDAS-aligned.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl mb-8"><h2 style="font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">LOVE Protocol</h2><p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:1rem;">LOVE ($LOVE) is a non-extractive care-credit protocol. Each hour of verified care coordination, transport, advocacy, or sensory regulation generates LOVE rewards recorded on the P31 LOVE ledger. Rewards are redeemable within the care mesh for respite, tools, or community support.</p><div class="grid-3"><div class="text-center p-3" style="background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);"><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent-violet);">Issuance</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;margin-top:0.25rem;color:var(--text-tertiary);">1 hr care = 1 LOVE</div></div><div class="text-center p-3" style="background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);"><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent);">Privacy</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;margin-top:0.25rem;color:var(--text-tertiary);">&#x3B5;=0.5 DP &middot; blinded</div></div><div class="text-center p-3" style="background:var(--glass-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);"><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent-green);">Redemption</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;margin-top:0.25rem;color:var(--text-tertiary);">respite &middot; tools &middot; support</div></div></div></div>
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl text-center"><p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Want to join the care mesh? The LOVE onboarding panel is available on our community site.</p><a href="https://p31ca.org/love" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-lg" style="font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--accent-violet);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;">Open LOVE Panel &rarr;</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

